BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.130 0.130 0.130 rg 46.0 488.3 Td (Arm reaction torques transmitted through a rigidly held payload slip the wheels during the flip and the loaded turn. Because the choreography is identical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.130 0.130 0.130 rg 46.0 474.2 Td (every cycle, the resulting odometry error is repeatable rather than random - which means a hard-coded odometric shelf pose fails the same way every) Tj ET
